      "commit": {
        "parents": [
          {
            "commit": "a9786fb0f7cf34220796a20192de4915aa5fadc7",
            "subject": "LU-10026 llite: set max compression size to 64 MiB"
          }
        ],
        "author": {
          "name": "Sebastien Buisson",
          "email": "sbuisson@ddn.com",
          "date": "2026-05-28 19:30:14.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Marc Vef",
          "email": "mvef@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-05-28 19:30:14.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-10026 sec: disable compression for encrypted files",
        "message": "LU-10026 sec: disable compression for encrypted files\n\nIn case a read-modify-write io pattern is carried out on a compressed\nfile, it has to be handled on server side.\nBut because encryption cannot be done on server side for security\nreasons, we are not able to handle that kind of io pattern if the file\nis encrypted + compressed.\nSo just disable compression for all encrypted files.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nSigned-off-by: Sebastien Buisson <sbuisson@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I84881fb1235f015d022751d4cce2d43a7231c2b4\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
